# "If the creature deals damage to a creature this turn, the creature dealt damage can't be regenerated this turn" is about
# damage dealt to a creature (CR 120.3d-e, 701.19c): Bot1's Runesworded Triskelion pings Bot2's Daretti, Scrap Savant while
# it is no creature, only an artifact under Mycosynth Lattice. Ensoul Artifact then makes it a 5/5 creature, Death Ward
# gives it a regeneration shield and Shatter destroys it. It can be regenerated, so two replacement effects apply - the
# regeneration and Runesword's exile, since it is now a creature dealt damage by the targeted creature (CR 614.1a, 700.4) -
# and Bot2 orders the regeneration first (CR 616.1): it stays, tapped, and nothing is exiled.
